<title>USA: Davel to buy Mississippi pay phone company.</title>
<headline>Davel to buy Mississippi pay phone company.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davel Communications Group Inc said Thursday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire the assets of Pay Telephone America Ltd for about $3.5 million.</p>
<p>The company's assets consist of about 1,000 installed pay telephones and related equipment, inventory and location agreements.</p>
<p>Davel said it expects the acquisition to close in early November. Pay Telephone America is based in Jackson, Miss.</p>
</text>
